{{define "content"}}
<hgroup>
<h1>Log level</h1>
<p>The application log is at <strong>{{.Data.Configured}}</strong>, as observability.log_level sets it. A window of debug lets its lines of debug pass too, on every instance, for a while; those of a flow, an app or a request alone when it has a scope. They hold names, never values.</p>
</hgroup>
{{template "notice" .}}
{{- with .Data}}
{{template "general" .Errors}}
{{- with .Window}}
<article>
<p>A window of debug is open until <time datetime="{{.UntilISO}}">{{.Until}}</time>, opened by {{.UpdatedBy}}. Its scope:
{{- if or .Flow .App .TraceID}}
{{- if .Flow}} the flow <code>{{.Flow}}</code>{{end}}
{{- if .App}}{{if .Flow}},{{end}} the app <code>{{.App}}</code>{{end}}
{{- if .TraceID}}{{if or .Flow .App}},{{end}} the request <code>{{.TraceID}}</code>{{end}}.
{{- else}} every line.
{{- end}}</p>
{{- if $.CanWrite}}
<form method="post" action="{{$.Base}}/log-level">
<input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="{{$.CSRF}}">
<button type="submit" name="action" value="close">Close the window</button>
</form>
{{- end}}
</article>
{{- else}}
<p>No window of debug is open.</p>
{{- end}}
<form method="post" action="{{$.Base}}/log-level">
<input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="{{$.CSRF}}">
<fieldset{{if not $.CanWrite}} disabled{{end}}>
<legend>{{if .Window}}Another window, in place of this one{{else}}A window of debug{{end}}</legend>
<label>Duration
<select name="duration"{{if .Errors.For "duration"}} aria-invalid="true"{{end}}>
{{- range .Durations}}
<option value="{{.Value}}"{{if .Selected}} selected{{end}}>{{.Value}}</option>
{{- end}}
</select>
{{template "errors" .Errors.For "duration"}}
<small>At most observability.debug_max_duration; then the configured level comes back by itself.</small>
</label>
<label>Flow
<select name="flow"{{if .Errors.For "flow"}} aria-invalid="true"{{end}}>
<option value="">Every flow</option>
{{- range .Flows}}
<option value="{{.}}"{{if eq . $.Data.Flow}} selected{{end}}>{{.}}</option>
{{- end}}
</select>
{{template "errors" .Errors.For "flow"}}
</label>
<label>App
<select name="app"{{if .Errors.For "app"}} aria-invalid="true"{{end}}>
<option value="">Every app</option>
{{- range .Apps}}
<option value="{{.}}"{{if eq . $.Data.App}} selected{{end}}>{{.}}</option>
{{- end}}
</select>
{{template "errors" .Errors.For "app"}}
</label>
<label>Trace id
<input name="trace_id" value="{{.TraceID}}" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="every request"{{if .Errors.For "trace_id"}} aria-invalid="true"{{end}}>
{{template "errors" .Errors.For "trace_id"}}
<small>32 hexadecimal digits: the trace_id of a line, or of an error page.</small>
</label>
</fieldset>
{{- if $.CanWrite}}
<button type="submit" name="action" value="open">Open the window</button>
{{- end}}
</form>
{{- end}}
{{end}}
